---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import OrbStage from '../../components/OrbStage.astro';
import { downloads } from '../../config/downloads';
---

<Base
  title="Feeling overwhelmed before your period, and how to steady it · Niyora"
  description="When an ordinary load feels impossible before your period, that is premenstrual overwhelm. Here is the science behind it and what actually helps you steady the moment."
  canonicalUrl="https://niyora.com/pms/overwhelm/"
>
  <OrbStage />

  <main class="content">
    <section class="hero" data-hue="280" data-sat="60%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Feeling overwhelmed before your period</div>
      <h1>Feeling overwhelmed before your period, and how to steady it</h1>
      <p class="lede">In the days before your period, an ordinary to-do list can feel impossible. Same plate, smaller hands. This is not you failing to cope. Your capacity to buffer stress quietly dips for a few days, and it refills as the shift passes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="explain-section" data-hue="278" data-sat="55%">
      <h2>Why everything feels like too much</h2>
      <div class="science">
        <p>The system that helps you absorb stress runs at lower power this week. Progesterone breaks down into a steadying compound, allopregnanolone, that helps you soak up pressure through the GABA system. As progesterone falls before your period, that buffer thins, so a regular load feels heavier than it is.</p>
        <p>Your hormone levels are normal. Women who feel flooded and women who feel steady have the same measured levels. The difference is how strongly your nervous system responds to the shift, and some systems feel it more. The overwhelm is a capacity thing right now, not a you thing.</p>
        <p>And your buffer refills on its own. Same week next cycle, the same list will feel doable again. As the shift passes, usually once your period starts, your capacity comes back. It thins with the shift, and it refills with the next one, every cycle.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rrr-section" data-hue="230" data-sat="60%">
      <h2>What helps when it all feels like too much</h2>
      <p class="lede">Niyora is built for the moment everything piles up. Three small steps, about a minute, to bring the load back to size.</p>
      <div class="rrr-grid">
        <div class="rrr-card">
          <div class="rrr-label">Reflect</div>
          <p>Name the moment. Seeing that your buffer is thin for a few days, not that you are suddenly unable to handle your life, brings the load back to its real size.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rrr-card">
          <div class="rrr-label">Regulate</div>
          <p>Settle your body in about a minute. A slower breath lowers the flooded feeling, which is what gives you room to think instead of just brace.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rrr-card">
          <div class="rrr-label">Respond</div>
          <p>With a steadier body, pick the one thing that actually needs you now and let the rest wait. You meet the load in pieces, not all at once.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="related-section" data-hue="248" data-sat="55%">
      <h2>Keep reading</h2>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/blog/how-to-calm-down-fast/" class="cta ghost">How to calm down fast</a>
        <a href="/blog/managing-emotional-changes-during-pms/" class="cta ghost">Managing emotional changes during PMS</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section" data-hue="30" data-sat="70%">
      <h2>Not sure the overwhelmed week is PMS?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Take the two-minute check and see how your premenstrual week actually hits.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/quiz" class="cta">Take the quiz</a>
        <a href={downloads.appStore} class="cta ghost">Get Niyora</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="/quiz">Take the quiz</a>
    <a href="/blog/">Writing</a>
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
    <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
    <div class="copyright">© 2026 Niyora. Built quietly in Norway.</div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 72px 40px;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 26px auto;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(12, 10, 20, 0.24);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.15);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.15);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    section { margin: 14px; border-radius: 24px; padding: 56px 20px; }
  }

  .hero { padding: 96px 40px 80px; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 75%, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    max-width: 780px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 720px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
  }
  p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66); max-width: 640px; }
  p.lede { font-size: 20px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74); line-height: 1.55; }

  .science {
    max-width: 720px;
    padding: 32px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid hsla(var(--orb-hue), 55%, 60%, 0.3);
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .science p { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); max-width: none; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .science p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .rrr-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    text-align: left;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .rrr-card {
    padding: 24px 22px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid hsla(var(--orb-hue), 55%, 60%, 0.35);
    background: var(--glass-bg-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
  }
  .rrr-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 80%, 0.95);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }
  .rrr-card p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: none; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .rrr-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  }

  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 12px; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    color: rgba(18, 16, 32, 0.95);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 55%, 0.35), 0 0 64px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 60%, 0.2);
  }
  .cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 70%, 32%, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 80%, 70%, 0.45), 0 14px 48px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 80%, 60%, 0.75);
  }
  .cta.ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    box-shadow: none;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .cta.ghost:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 13px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  footer a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 14px; }
  footer a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }
  footer .copyright { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    p.lede { font-size: 17px; }
    .science p { font-size: 16px; }
  }
</style>
